{"version":1,"content":"<p>科學家近日宣佈確認一種此前從未被正式描述的蝴蝶新物種，並將其命名為 Satyrium curiosolus。這種蝴蝶數十年來一直生活在人類已知的自然環境中，卻因與近緣物種外形極為相似而長期未被識別，成為一個典型「隱存物種」案例。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1583618.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T19:04:39.397868+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T18:40:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T18:58:25.087661+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T18:58:25.087661+00:00","content_hash":"23b621e12b4a408de5a62671ef1c5875ad6bfeb5df75a7b1d685cdecab2030ec","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}